## 13. Conclusion

SupplySync demonstrates the practical application of SQL in wholesale distribution and supply chain management. By combining relational database design, inventory monitoring, supplier evaluation, business analytics and query optimization, the project provides a structured approach to managing distribution operations efficiently.

